 *    - Subtle gradient accent line.
 * 2. Hero Image & Practice Areas Menu:
 *    - Unclipped showcase frame with object-contain and aspect-[2752/1536].
 *    - 5 Other Practice Areas (current practice excluded).
 *    - Active blue hover with deep blue gradient and white text.
 * 3. Narrative & 4 Square Capabilities Cards (Below Section):
 *    - Headline placed directly BEFORE narrative: "Your Partner in Federal Recruitment Services"
 *    - Exact user narrative paragraphs highlighting full recruitment lifecycle and active/passive sourcing.
 *    - Direct HubSpot "Book a Meeting" button.
 *    - 4 Center-aligned square cards highlighting Recruitment Capabilities.
 * 4. Section 2 ("Our Expertise"):
 *    - 3 Cards with Prism Spotlight Stage animation (Security-Cleared Recruitment, Custom Talent Solutions, Federal Hiring).
 * 5. Section 3 ("Who We Serve" - CREATIVE BENTO COMMAND HUB):
 *    - Interactive Segmented Persona Switcher (SMBs vs Government Contractors) with dynamic spring transitions.
 *    - 6 Expansive, high-visual 3D Bento Cards per audience with contextual badges, floating icon physics, and cursor spotlights.
 * 6. Section 4 ("How We Support Our Clients"):
 *    - Bottom-to-top shuttle fill cards for both SMBs and Government Contractors.
 * 7. Section 5 ("Agencies We've Successfully Recruited For" - 3D HOLOGRAPHIC VAULT CAROUSEL):
 *    - Big luxury square-like cards (aspect-[4/4.5]) featuring giant faint acronym watermarks (DOD, DHS, NASA, DOE, DOJ, DOS, DOC).
 *    - Floating holographic agency seal pedestals with specular glass sheen and sonar hover pulse.
 *    - Interactive next/prev glass controls, smooth inertia glide, drag/swipe, and pagination dots.
 * 8. Section 6 ("Ready to Secure Your Cleared Workforce?"):
 *    - Recruitment-specific CTA banner with direct HubSpot booking and contact links.
 * 9. Alternating backgrounds: White -> Blue -> White -> Blue -> White -> Blue.
 */
